<title>USA: FMR group holds 12.96 pct Staples stake.</title>
<headline>FMR group holds 12.96 pct Staples stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Thursday it holds a 12.96 percent stake in Staples Inc or 20,725,148 common shares.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Staples in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
<p>FMR Corp is the parent of the investment adviser to Fidelity Funds.</p>
</text>
